# SERIAL alone, SPACE held for 3 s with Windows' key repeat (BUGS.md K4).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame serial --headless --ms 125000 --key-repeat 500,33 --input tools/play/serial-held-space.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame serial --headless --ms 125000 --key-repeat 500,33 --fix all,-serial_intro_screen,-serial_end_screen --input tools/play/serial-held-space.input
#
# (500,33 is the default of every run; the flag makes the script independent
# of it.) Aimed right, SPACE is held from 7500 to 10500 ms
# (`tools/serial_plan.py --start 0 --check` with each version):
# - Original: the press and every repeat with the bullet free fire again: 4
#   shots, 3spira hit (-100) at 8215, the rabbit (+100) at 10662: score 0;
# - `--fix all`: the latch holds the repeats off: one shot, 3spira: -100.
# Nothing else is shot. The Original survives the clock with 2 lives
# (K1/K2: MAKELONG(2, 500)); the Corrigida's other figures (K5: lane 2 on
# its own timer) take the five lives at 109400: a loss of -100.
7200 key right
7500 hold space 3000
8300 dump held
121000 result won 32768002 | lost -100
